  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAC Integrated Humanitarian Response to conflict-affected communities in North Darfur.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since April 2023, approximately 379,000 individuals, primarily women, children, and persons with disabilities, have been displaced in North Darfur.
These displaced populations are facing severe basic needs. Protection vulnerabilities are acute, and Health, nutrition, shelter, sanitation, water, and protection systems are collapsing
CAFOD&#x2019;s integrated protection and nutrition intervention in Tawila directly addresses these urgent needs, providing essential lifesaving services while strengthening community resilience and safeguarding dignity for thousands of IDPs and host families in one of Darfur&#x2019;s hardest-hit localities</narrative>
  </description>
